   "source": [
    "# 03 · Train Model B (tasks T10, T14)\n",
    "\n",
    "Trains **Model B** using AASIST with **Focal Loss ($\gamma=2.0$)**, **Frequency Feature Masking (`Freq_aug=True`)**, **Stochastic Weight Averaging (SWA)**, and multi-condition noise/reverb augmentation.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Progress Saving & Resumability:** The script **saves progress every 10 minutes** (`SAVE_EVERY_MINUTES` in `scripts/config.py`). If Colab disconnects, simply reopen this notebook and rerun: it resumes seamlessly from the last save.\n",
    "\n",
    "**First run timing:** Time the first epoch. The log displays minutes per epoch and estimated hours remaining (~6.5 hours per seed)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Run this first in EVERY new Colab session.\n",
    "from google.colab import drive\n",
    "drive.mount('/content/drive')\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "BASE = '/content/drive/MyDrive/mini_project'\n",
    "REPO = f'{BASE}/repo'\n",
    "FAST = '/content/fast'          # Colab's fast local disk\n",
    "os.environ.pop('MP_DATA', None)\n",
    "assert os.path.exists(REPO), 'Repo not found - run notebook 01 first.'\n",
    "os.chdir(REPO)\n",
    "\n",
    "# GitHub login from Colab Secrets (key icon on the left): GITHUB_USER, GITHUB_TOKEN.\n",
    "from google.colab import userdata\n",
    "try:\n",
    "    GH_USER = userdata.get('GITHUB_USER')\n",
    "    GH_TOKEN = userdata.get('GITHUB_TOKEN')\n",
    "    with open('/root/.git-credentials', 'w') as f:\n",
    "        f.write(f'https://{GH_USER}:{GH_TOKEN}@github.com\\n')\n",
    "    os.chmod('/root/.git-credentials', 0o600)\n",
    "    !git config --global credential.helper store\n",
    "    !git config --global user.name \"{GH_USER}\"\n",
    "    !git config --global user.email \"{GH_USER}@users.noreply.github.com\"\n",
    "    print('GitHub login ready for', GH_USER)\n",
    "except Exception as e:\n",
    "    print('No GitHub secrets found - git pull/push will be skipped.', type(e).__name__)\n",
    "\n",
    "!git pull -q || echo \"(git pull skipped)\"\n",
    "\n",
    "!pip install -q audiomentations speechbrain soundfile librosa tqdm\n",
    "\n",
    "# Copy the datasets from Drive (one archive each) to the fast local disk.\n",
    "# Takes a few minutes per session; everything afterwards is much faster.\n",
    "!python scripts/fast_data.py unpack\n",
    "!python scripts/config.py"
   ],
